abstract: >-
  Research software and an accompanying mathematical report on conditional
  fibers induced by incomplete observations of finite-dimensional inverse
  problems. The repository separates proved abstract results, local
  quantitative estimates, numerical EIT evidence, external conditional
  consequences, and open application-wide assumptions.
